<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-PhyMatrix rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PhyMatrix rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it initiated coverage of PhyMatrix Corp with a one-one (outperform) rating.</p>
<p>--It said the company's stock can appreciate 50 percent in the next 6 to 18 months.</p>
<p>--EVEREN's targets on the stock are $18 for the six months and $22 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>--PhyMatrix, a physician practice management company that had its initial public offering in January 1996, was trading at 14-3/4, up 3/4.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
